  "comments": "Also referred to as \"rGya 'Dul 'dzin the younger\" to distinguish him from \"rGya 'Dul 'dzin the older\" (ID:3941). See [647FFPZR]: 541.\r\nIt is unclear whether he is the same person as Bya 'dul ba 'dzin pa (ID:3818). The [NA9AMDH6] distinguishes two \"rGya 'dul 'dzin\" - the elder (ID: 3941) and the younger (ID:4193) - and a \"Bya 'dul 'dzin brTson 'grus 'bar\" (student of 'Bre chen po). In contrast, the [MQB8JGAX] only mentions one \"rGya 'dul 'dzin\" (the elder), distinct from \"Bya 'dul 'dzin\" (who was ordained by 'Bre). \r\nA number of the same teachers are mentioned for rGya 'dul 'dzin the younger and Bya 'dul 'dzin but, for instance, the latter's studies with rGya 'dul 'dzin the older took place when he was a retired abbot, whereas the former's studies with him took place when he was still abbot.\r\nFurther, rGya 'dul 'dzin the younger became abbot of dGa' ba sdong and Bya 'dul abbot of Zul phu.\r\nThis suggests they might have been distinct persons.",
